   "why": "A vacation week pays VACATION_WEEK_PAY_MIN (2640 = 44 h) ONCE for the week, never per day, on top of anything actually worked that week. It is scheduled always, and actual from the Sunday it starts. daysWorked counts days actually worked, so vacation days are not among them.",
